{"id":"schwanz","lemma":"Schwanz","pos":"noun","rank":1156,"glosses":["tail","cock, dick, penis","prick, dickhead"],"ipa":"/ʃvan(t)s/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/1b/De-Schwanz.ogg/De-Schwanz.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Schwanzes","plural":"Schwänze"},"examples":[{"text":"Mein Hund hat einen langen Schwanz.","en":"My dog has a long tail.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/758706","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"dog, hound"},{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},{"g":"to reach, to grab"},null]},{"text":"Tritt dem Hund nicht auf den Schwanz.","en":"Don't step on the dog's tail.","words":[{"g":"to step, to walk","l":"treten"},{"g":"(to) the","l":"der"},{"g":"dog, hound"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},null]},{"text":"Der Hund wedelte mit dem Schwanz.","en":"The dog wagged its tail.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"dog, hound"},null,{"g":"with"},{"g":"(to) the","l":"der"},null]},{"text":"Kaninchen haben lange Ohren und kurze Schwänze.","en":"Rabbits have long ears and short tails.","words":[{"g":"rabbit"},{"g":"have"},{"g":"long, for a long time"},{"g":"ear","l":"Ohr"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"short, quick, brief","l":"kurz"},null]},{"text":"Eine Katze hat einen Schwanz und vier Beine.","en":"A cat has a tail and four legs.","words":[{"g":"a"},{"g":"house cat"},{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},null,{"g":"and"},{"g":"four (numerical value…"},{"g":"leg of a person","l":"Bein"}]}]}